    "Licona, M. (2017). Why Are There Differences in the Gospels? What We Can Learn from Ancient Biography. Oxford University Press.",
    "Walsh, R. F. (2021). The Origins of Early Christian Literature. Cambridge University Press.",
    "Suetonius, Augustus 94. Plutarch, Romulus 27–28.",
